From c893a1ca28b878d8ba0be8bcfc5c33381902d8aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yalunfan <yalunfan33@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 02:51:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gemma4): add bf16 expert store adapter

Preserve packed expert dtype and HF routing scales, with native dispatch safe under inference mode.
